  "title": "When a LIMS Is Not Enough for Translational Multi‑Omics Labs",
  "summary": "A growing translational multi-omics team can outgrow spreadsheets, shared drives, dashboards, and even a legacy LIMS long before the science slows down. This piece looks at what happens when sample lineage, inventory, sequencing workflows, and computational access live in separate systems, and why connected lab operations need a better data backbone.",
